  "body": "Set on a sunny road front 835sqm (appox) freehold title site sits this immaculate home and income only moments away from beautiful Rothesay Bay Beach. The property offers elevated sea views, a superb sun aspect, outdoor living space and comprises a total of 5 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms including the minor dwelling.\r\n\r\nIn the main home there is a well appointed kitchen with plenty of storage and superb interconnect to the spacious living area and dining area which flows to the outdoor balcony. A fabulous master bedroom complete with spacious wardrobe. A spacious second lounge downstairs is ideal for kids, teenagers or extended family to utilise and four additional bedrooms including a semi self contained 'granny flat'.\r\n\r\nThe income component of the property comprises one bedrooms, a bathroom and a well appointed kitchen, living and dining area. \r\n\r\nGreat school zones and in close proximity to great local cafes and shops.",
